      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Smithfield%2C_Rhode_Island"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The historic Esmond Mill, once a bustling textile plant, was destroyed by fire in 1882, a landmark event in town history.",
